# The context is packages/browseros-agent. Send only what Cargo needs to load the workspace and
# build the server: every member's manifest and sources (Cargo refuses a member it cannot read),
# the lockfile, and this folder. node_modules alone is about 2 GB.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!apps/claw-server
**/node_modules
# Only Cargo's output at the root: `**/target` would also drop source modules such as
# browseros-core/src/target/.
target
# The CAPTCHA testbed beside neo-captcha's sources is no build input either.
crates/neo-sdk/neo-captcha/testbed
# This folder's scripts and docs are not build inputs, so editing them leaves the image cached.
# The browser pin, the server's build step and the supervisor (supervisor/, its tests aside) are.
crates/neo-sdk/neo-server/docker
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-server/docker/browser.lock
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-server/docker/build-server.sh
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-server/docker/supervisor
crates/neo-sdk/neo-server/docker/supervisor/*_test.py
**/__pycache__
